#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:9
msgid "Version 0.2.0-beta.1 (2026-07-27)"
msgstr "버전 0.2.0-beta.1 (2026-07-27)"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:11
msgid ""
"The 0.2 series moves to beta. Superimposition is now complete — all three "
"methods work in 2D and 3D — and the documentation has been rebuilt against "
"the application after a long stretch where the published site was out of "
"date."
msgstr ""
"0.2 시리즈가 베타로 넘어갑니다. 중첩정렬이 완성되어 세 가지 방식 모두 2D와 3D에서 동작하며, 오랫동안 갱신되지 않았던 발행 "
"문서를 애플리케이션에 맞춰 다시 만들었습니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:16
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:97
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:120
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:164
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:195
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:253
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:281
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:353
msgid "Added"
msgstr "추가"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Bookstein superimposition.** Shapes are re-expressed as Bookstein shape "
"coordinates by fixing the dataset's baseline landmarks to a standard "
"position. Requires a baseline defined on the dataset."
msgstr ""
"**북스틴 중첩정렬.** 데이터셋의 베이스라인 랜드마크를 표준 위치에 고정하여 각 형상을 북스틴 형상좌표로 다시 표현합니다. 데이터셋에 "
"베이스라인이 정의되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Resistant Fit superimposition (RFTRA)**, in both 2D and 3D. It aligns "
"using repeated medians of pairwise landmark relationships, so a few "
"displaced landmarks do not drag the whole fit the way they can under "
"Procrustes."
msgstr ""
"**강건적합 중첩정렬(RFTRA)**, 2D와 3D 모두 지원합니다. 랜드마크 쌍 관계의 반복 중앙값으로 정렬하므로, 몇 개의 이탈 "
"랜드마크가 프로크루스테스에서처럼 전체 정합을 끌어당기지 않습니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:24
msgid "**Missing landmarks are imputed for Bookstein and Resistant Fit too.**"
msgstr "**북스틴과 강건적합에서도 결측 랜드마크를 대치합니다.**"

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:25
msgid ""
"**A Quick Start page**, a **file format reference**, a **glossary**, and a "
"section on **calibrating an object** against a known distance."
msgstr ""
"**빠른 시작 페이지**, **파일 형식 레퍼런스**, **용어집**, 그리고 알고 있는 거리를 기준으로 **객체를 캘리브레이션** 하는"
" 절을 추가했습니다."

#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:29
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:68
#: ../../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/changelog.rst:180
